{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>טרף</b> Twice in the Masorah: here and the other כי הוא טרף וירפאנו (Genesis 31:39). Just as there it is an expression of breaking, so too here — that she broke it from the tree and did not find it floating on the water, and by this he recognized that the waters had diminished."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:49.865326835Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}